# A pointer that only hovers does not start a game, a left click does, and
# a right click pauses it, resumes it and pauses it again. A right click on
# the title screen does nothing, but it pauses a game that a hover started.
# The title screen changes every frame, and a stopped program leaves the
# console cursor blinking every 30 frames, so an expect-same over exactly 30
# frames passes only on a paused game.
run 30
tablet at 160 120 0
run 20
tablet at 160 120 2
run 2
tablet at 160 120 0
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-changed
tablet at 160 120 1
run 2
tablet at 160 120 0
run 20
tablet at 160 120 2
run 2
tablet at 160 120 0
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-same
tablet at 160 120 2
run 2
tablet at 160 120 0
run 5
expect-changed
tablet at 160 120 2
run 2
tablet at 160 120 0
run 5
mark
run 30
expect-same
